flowchart TB
  browser[Browser: {{users.role.admin}}, {{users.role.operator}}, {{users.role.viewer}}]
  proxy[Reverse proxy: TLS on 443]
  cp[Control plane: web UI, API, scheduler, queue]
  db[(PostgreSQL)]
  agent[Agent service on each host]
  restic[restic on the host]
  repo[(Repository: S3, REST, SFTP, local)]

  browser -->|HTTPS 443| proxy
  proxy -->|HTTP 8080| cp
  cp --> db
  agent ==>|the agent opens the stream: gRPC, mTLS 8443| cp
  agent --> restic
  restic -->|backup data goes direct| repo
